829
01:10:21,671 --> 01:10:23,674
Verna, get on the fucking ground!

830
01:10:24,966 --> 01:10:26,260
Come here!

831
01:10:29,386 --> 01:10:31,055
Maybe I'm on a roll...

832
01:10:31,096 --> 01:10:33,099
...and I'll kill every damn Sawyer I see.

833
01:10:39,522 --> 01:10:41,692
Jed, Jed...

834
01:10:43,483 --> 01:10:47,697
<i>Jed... Are you okay down there?

835
01:10:50,365 --> 01:10:51,367
<i>Jed?

836
01:10:51,491 --> 01:10:52,994
<i>Come on, now.

837
01:10:57,040 --> 01:10:58,000
Hold on.

838
01:10:58,082 --> 01:11:00,709
Come on, we've got you. We've got you, Jed.

839
01:12:18,494 --> 01:12:21,707
This will hold it together while it heals...

840
01:12:24,000 --> 01:12:25,836
All right, you're going to feel this...

841
01:12:25,960 --> 01:12:27,460
I'm going to pull it pretty tight.

842
01:12:36,303 --> 01:12:37,597
All right...

843
01:12:43,601 --> 01:12:44,811
Jed...

844
01:13:18,718 --> 01:13:20,262
I'll help you.

845
01:13:22,430 --> 01:13:24,350
I swear.

846
01:13:26,433 --> 01:13:28,937
Untie me, please...

847
01:13:30,229 --> 01:13:31,606
Please...

848
01:13:32,523 --> 01:13:33,816
Why?

849
01:13:40,613 --> 01:13:42,909
What were you going to do to me?

850
01:13:45,495 --> 01:13:47,039
I don't know...

851
01:13:52,460 --> 01:13:56,421
I'm sorry, I am...

852
01:14:05,931 --> 01:14:07,685
Jesus Christ!

853
01:14:09,977 --> 01:14:11,396
Let's go...

854
01:14:23,116 --> 01:14:24,993
<i>Nubbins, come here.

855
01:14:36,963 --> 01:14:38,257
Bring your brother something to eat.

856
01:14:38,298 --> 01:14:39,548
All right.

857
01:14:46,095 --> 01:14:47,973
<i>They're gone! They're gone!

858
01:14:52,561 --> 01:14:54,188
Go, go...

859
01:15:01,694 --> 01:15:04,114
No!

860
01:15:04,197 --> 01:15:05,491
Leave her alone!

861
01:15:05,866 --> 01:15:07,285
No.

862
01:15:08,452 --> 01:15:10,370
Hurry, bring him.

863
01:15:19,545 --> 01:15:20,845
You messed with the wrong family!

864
01:15:20,880 --> 01:15:23,343
Yeah, you're proud of this damn family, aren't
you?

865
01:15:24,507 --> 01:15:25,551
Jed!

866
01:15:28,553 --> 01:15:29,931
Jed!

867
01:15:42,026 --> 01:15:43,904
Oh, fuck!

868
01:15:50,659 --> 01:15:52,954
What are you going to do?

869
01:16:03,672 --> 01:16:05,299
It's not over, boy!

870
01:16:05,549 --> 01:16:06,842
Goddamn it!

871
01:16:08,258 --> 01:16:10,052
This isn't over, damn it! You hear me?

872
01:16:10,134 --> 01:16:13,098
Jed, what have I told you about strangers?

873
01:16:13,264 --> 01:16:15,225
They fill your ears with lies...

874
01:16:15,266 --> 01:16:17,143
Show them who you are, Jed.

875
01:16:18,435 --> 01:16:20,939
Look what that man did to your face!

876
01:16:26,568 --> 01:16:28,153
Jackson, don't do it!

877
01:16:29,947 --> 01:16:31,616
No!

878
01:16:31,699 --> 01:16:33,743
Shut up. You're next, you hear me?

879
01:16:33,784 --> 01:16:34,744
Fuck you!

880
01:16:35,244 --> 01:16:36,872
No!

881
01:16:44,460 --> 01:16:45,671
No!

882
01:17:50,902 --> 01:17:52,320
Go, go, go! Get her now!

883
01:17:52,355 --> 01:17:53,197
Go get her!

884
01:17:54,739 --> 01:17:57,493
Jed, remember what I told you? Go get her.

885
01:17:57,700 --> 01:17:58,619
Get her, Jed!

886
01:17:59,953 --> 01:18:01,580
Nobody messes with our family!

887
01:19:50,393 --> 01:19:52,605
Help me!

888
01:19:55,815 --> 01:19:58,611
No!

889
01:20:17,212 --> 01:20:18,797
Jackson, don't do this!

890
01:20:20,130 --> 01:20:22,467
Please, don't do this!

891
01:20:23,592 --> 01:20:25,136
I tried to help you...

892
01:20:25,511 --> 01:20:27,305
That's all I ever tried to do.

893
01:20:27,555 --> 01:20:28,932
You know that, right?

894
01:20:29,640 --> 01:20:32,018
Listen to me, it's not too late...

895
01:20:32,476 --> 01:20:34,269
We can still get out of here together.

896
01:20:34,560 --> 01:20:36,312
That bitch is a liar, Jed!

897
01:20:36,895 --> 01:20:38,356
She doesn't care about you...

898
01:20:38,814 --> 01:20:40,568
Kill her! Kill her now!

899
01:20:40,608 --> 01:20:42,361
Please don't listen to her.

900
01:20:43,319 --> 01:20:44,738
Please.

901
01:20:45,196 --> 01:20:46,657
I know there's good in you...

902
01:20:47,115 --> 01:20:48,241
I've seen it.

903
01:20:48,907 --> 01:20:52,120
Please listen to me. This isn't you, Jackson!

904
01:20:53,370 --> 01:20:54,539
This isn't you!

905
01:20:55,080 --> 01:20:56,667
It's your crazy mother!

906
01:20:57,083 --> 01:20:58,210
It's her...

907
01:21:14,143 --> 01:21:15,687
That's my boy!

908
01:21:16,228 --> 01:21:17,937
You did good, Jed.

909
01:21:21,607 --> 01:21:23,568
You made your mama proud.

910
01:21:26,528 --> 01:21:30,284
<i>No!

911
01:23:52,296 --> 01:24:47,852
<i>Leatherface (2017)
Subtitles by TaMaBin
